# Shocker, Unshakable: "When Shocker enters, he deals 2 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller." The
# creature is the ability's only target, so when it is gone as the ability resolves the ability does nothing at all (CR 608.2b): the
# 2 to its controller as well. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Shocker and targets Bot2's Wall of Earth; in response Bot2 returns the Wall to
# their hand with Unsummon, paid with Mox Sapphire. Bot2 stays at 20.

